-- ex35 def row: a derived column and a derived field. Twin of 064-two-habitats.bqn.
-- The def row: threat derived from three columns, ridge derived from two coordinates — one mechanism, both habitats.
-- def threat = Dmg*Spd / Rng read back as a query (left-assoc: (Dmg*Spd)/Rng, exact at every row); ridge modeled with exact arithmetic (x + y) in place of sin per the .bqn, written into the 4x4 ridge field. ridge starts at -1 junk to prove the full overwrite; the expect is the row-major ravel of the .bqn's +⌜˜↕4.
--! registry ../registries/068-two-habitats-e.reg
--! expect ridge = 0 1 2 3 1 2 3 4 2 3 4 5 3 4 5 6

def threat = Dmg*Spd / Rng
--! out 6 10 4
threat

def ridge = x + y
4 4 , Ridge = ridge
